[{'publication_number': 'AT-E152950-T1', 'application_number': 'AT-96104644-T', 'country_code': 'AT', 'kind_code': 'T1', 'application_kind': 'T', 'application_number_formatted': 'AT96104644T', 'pct_number': '', 'family_id': '7758635', 'spif_publication_number': '', 'spif_application_number': '', 'title_localized': '[\n  {\n    "language": "de",\n    "text": "Einrichtung zum absaugen von mittels eines hohlfräswerkzeuges abgetragener späne",\n    "truncated": false\n  }\n]', 'abstract_localized': '[\n  {\n    "language": "en",\n    "text": "The milling tool (4) has a hollow working head into which are drawn the chippings (20) and dust, preferably from elastic material such as plastic or wood. The suction duct is a tube (2) fixed rigidly wrt. the tool and passing through the drive head (1) of the machine. This enables the suction hose (15) to be fitted with a minimum of complexity eg. no rotating seals required. An alternate solution has the driving shaft inside the fixed duct to provide extraction over the working area of the tool. In this design the extract hose is attached to a side arm at the upper end of the duct near the machine.",\n    "truncated": false\n  }\n]', 'claims_localized': '[]', 'claims_localized_html': '[]', 'description_localized': '[]', 'description_localized_html': '[]', 'publication_date': 19970515, 'filing_date': 19960323, 'grant_date': 19970515, 'priority_date': 19950403, 'priority_claim': '[\n  {\n    "application_number": "DE-19512401-A",\n    "category": "",\n    "filing_date": 19950403,\n    "npl_text": "",\n    "publication_number": "",\n    "type": ""\n  }\n]', 'inventor': '[\n  "BORNEMANN, HERMANN"\n]', 'inventor_harmonized': '[\n  {\n    "country_code": "DE",\n    "name": "BORNEMANN HERMANN"\n  }\n]', 'assignee': '[\n  "Bornemann Werkzeugtechnik Gmbh"\n]', 'assignee_harmonized': '[\n  {\n    "country_code": "DE",\n    "name": "BORNEMANN WERKZEUGTECHNIK GMBH"\n  }\n]', 'examiner': '[]', 'uspc': '[]', 'ipc': '[\n  {\n    "code": "B08B15/04",\n    "first": false,\n    "inventive": true,\n    "tree": []\n  },\n  {\n    "code": "B23Q11/00",\n    "first": false,\n    "inventive": true,\n    "tree": []\n  }\n]', 'cpc': '[\n  {\n    "code": "B08B15/04",\n    "first": true,\n    "inventive": true,\n    "tree": []\n  },\n  {\n    "code": "B23Q11/0046",\n    "first": false,\n    "inventive": true,\n    "tree": []\n  }\n]', 'fi': '[]', 'fterm': '[]', 'locarno': '[]', 'citation': '[]', 'parent': '[]', 'child': '[]', 'entity_status': '', 'art_unit': ''}, {'publication_number': 'AT-E208695-T1', 'application_number': 'AT-96119677-T', 'country_code': 'AT', 'kind_code': 'T1', 'application_kind': 'T', 'application_number_formatted': 'AT96119677T', 'pct_number': '', 'family_id': '7781268', 'spif_publication_number': '', 'spif_application_number': '', 'title_localized': '[\n  {\n    "language": "de",\n    "text": "Verfahren zur trocknung und konditionierung von expandierbaren styrolpolymerisaten und vorrichtung zur durchfürung des verfahrens",\n    "truncated": false\n  }\n]', 'abstract_localized': '[\n  {\n    "language": "en",\n    "text": "The two-stage process is for drying and conditioning expandable styrene polymers (EPS) obtained by suspension polymerisation in presence of blowing agent, followed by separation on a centrifuge to give EPS with a residual moisture content of ca. 2% and an average particle diameter of 0.1-3.0 mm. The process comprises : (a) passing the EPS (1) through a drier (2) with a first gas stream (3) with a temperature of 20-40 degrees C, a gas/EPS ratio of 1.3-1.9 kg/kg and a residence time of 0.05-0.2 minutes then separating the EPS from the gas, and (b) contacting the EPS in a second drier (7) with a second gas stream (8) at 20-40 degrees C, with a residence time of 240-480 minutes from product inlet to outlet and a gas/EPS ratio of 0.15-0.6 kg/kg, and with the gas flow in the same and/or opposite direction to the product flow, the gas being divided into different streams (9), fed into the EPS at different levels one above the other and re-dissipitated between these levels. Also claimed is an apparatus for t his process.",\n    "truncated": false\n  }\n]', 'claims_localized': '[]', 'claims_localized_html': '[]', 'description_localized': '[]', 'description_localized_html': '[]', 'publication_date': 20011115, 'filing_date': 19961209, 'grant_date': 20011115, 'priority_date': 19951227, 'priority_claim': '[\n  {\n    "application_number": "DE-19548515-A",\n    "category": "",\n    "filing_date": 19951227,\n    "npl_text": "",\n    "publication_number": "",\n    "type": ""\n  }\n]', 'inventor': '[\n  "HAMANN, BERND, DR.",\n  "BAGERITZ, HANS",\n  "KLODT, ROLF-DIETER, DR.",\n  "BOGER, JUERGEN",\n  "WINZHEIMER, BODO",\n  "LEHMANN, REINHARD"\n]', 'inventor_harmonized': '[\n  {\n    "country_code": "DE",\n    "name": "HAMANN BERND DR"\n  },\n  {\n    "country_code": "DE",\n    "name": "BAGERITZ HANS"\n  },\n  {\n    "country_code": "DE",\n    "name": "KLODT ROLF-DIETER DR"\n  },\n  {\n    "country_code": "DE",\n    "name": "BOGER JUERGEN"\n  },\n  {\n    "country_code": "DE",\n    "name": "WINZHEIMER BODO"\n  },\n  {\n    "country_code": "DE",\n    "name": "LEHMANN REINHARD"\n  }\n]', 'assignee': '[\n  "Buna Sow Leuna Olefinverb Gmbh"\n]', 'assignee_harmonized': '[\n  {\n    "country_code": "DE",\n    "name": "BUNA SOW LEUNA OLEFINVERB GMBH"\n  }\n]', 'examiner': '[]', 'uspc': '[]', 'ipc': '[\n  {\n    "code": "B29B13/06",\n    "first": false,\n    "inventive": true,\n    "tree": []\n  },\n  {\n    "code": "C08J9/22",\n    "first": false,\n    "inventive": true,\n    "tree": []\n  },\n  {\n    "code": "C08L25/04",\n    "first": false,\n    "inventive": true,\n    "tree": []\n  },\n  {\n    "code": "F26B17/10",\n    "first": false,\n    "inventive": true,\n    "tree": []\n  },\n  {\n    "code": "F26B17/14",\n    "first": false,\n    "inventive": true,\n    "tree": []\n  }\n]', 'cpc': '[\n  {\n    "code": "C08J9/22",\n    "first": true,\n    "inventive": true,\n    "tree": []\n  },\n  {\n    "code": "B29B13/065",\n    "first": false,\n    "inventive": true,\n    "tree": []\n  },\n  {\n    "code": "B29K2025/00",\n    "first": false,\n    "inventive": false,\n    "tree": []\n  },\n  {\n    "code": "C08J2325/04",\n    "first": false,\n    "inventive": false,\n    "tree": []\n  },\n  {\n    "code": "F26B17/101",\n    "first": false,\n    "inventive": true,\n    "tree": []\n  },\n  {\n    "code": "F26B17/1416",\n    "first": false,\n    "inventive": true,\n    "tree": []\n  }\n]', 'fi': '[]', 'fterm': '[]', 'locarno': '[]', 'citation': '[]', 'parent': '[]', 'child': '[]', 'entity_status': '', 'art_unit': ''}, {'publication_number': 'AT-E217560-T1', 'application_number': 'AT-97903856-T', 'country_code': 'AT', 'kind_code': 'T1', 'application_kind': 'T', 'application_number_formatted': 'AT97903856T', 'pct_number': '', 'family_id': '24487533', 'spif_publication_number': '', 'spif_application_number': '', 'title_localized': '[\n  {\n    "language": "de",\n    "text": "Vorrichtung und verfahren zum schärfen eines längliches rotierendes werkzeuges",\n    "truncated": false\n  }\n]', 'abstract_localized': '[\n  {\n    "language": "en",\n    "text": "A method of, and apparatus for, treating an elongate rotary tool that presents a sharp cutting edge are described. The method includes the steps of emitting under pressure from a nozzle an abrasive fluid stream comprising an abrasive grit entrained in a fluid; and impinging the abrasive fluid stream against the sharp cutting edge of the elongate rotary tool for a preselected time so as to transform the sharp cutting edge into a relatively uniformly honed edge. The apparatus includes a rotatable fixture that releasably holds the elongate rotary tool. A nozzle that emits under pressure an abrasive steam. The nozzle and the elongate rotary tool are relatively moveable so that the abrasive stream impinges the entire length of the sharp cutting edge.",\n    "truncated": false\n  }\n]', 'claims_